text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_08170CA7 {
    "Allì adelante hay un desierto abarrotado\nde entrenadores fortìsimos"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_08170D02 {
    "DESIERTO de entrenadores.\p“A pan duro, diente agudo”\p"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_08170D1E {
    " pan duro, diente agudo”\p"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B0E3F {
    "This tree looks like it can be CUT down.\pWould you like to CUT it?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B88D4 {
    "Enfréntate al ciberpoder de mi pokemon.\nEl soldado eléctrico"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B8911 {
    "¡¡Mi ciberpokemon!!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B8925 {
    "Todo lo cíber mola\p…los cibercafés…\p…los cíberpokemon."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B895E {
    "After I lost to you, I learned a bunch\nof things about POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B899E {
    "I lost again?\nWhy couldn’t I win?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B89C0 {
    "I’m fabulously wealthy, but I can’t\nseem to win at POKéMON...\pIt’s so deep, the world of POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B933A {
    "The sea is like my backyard.\nLet’s battle!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B9365 {
    "I lost on my home field...\nI’m in shock!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B938E {
    "I swim the seas with a heart full of\ndreams...\pIt’s a song!\nAnyways, I’m swimming some more."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B93EB {
    "Swimming in the big, wide sea, my\nPOKéMON has grown stronger!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B9429 {
    "What a shock!\pMy POKéMON has gotten stronger, but\nI stayed weak as a TRAINER!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081B9477 {
    "What you learn in battle makes you a\nstronger TRAINER.\lThe waves taught me that."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD49E {
    "ROSELIA es una rosa  \ny una rosa es una rosa, es una rosa."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD4D9 {
    "…y sus espinas no respetan."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD4F9 {
    "AMAR es el empiece de la palabra\nAMARGURA…\pNo intento deprimirte sino enseñarte\nque hasta las rosas más bonitas\lTienen espinas.\p¿Las espinas crecen con el tiempo? \n¡Compruébalo!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD569 {
    "Tienen espinas.\p¿Las espinas crecen con el tiempo? \n¡Compruébalo!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD5AB {
    "¡Que guay!\n¡Sabes un montón sobre  POKéMON!\p¡Con lo pequeñ{RIVAL} que eres…"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD5F2 {
    "Eres muy bueno \ncomo premio te voy a dar esta HM:\pObtuviste HM01."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD79A {
    "I’m in the middle of a triathlon, but,\nwhatever, let’s have a battle!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD7E0 {
    "I ran out of energy!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD7F5 {
    "I may have blown it...\pI might have dropped to last during\nthat battle..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD83F {
    "I’m smack in the middle of a triathlon,\nbut I’m comfortably ahead.\lLet’s make this a quick battle!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD8A2 {
    "I ran out of energy again!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD8BD {
    "I was tops in swimming and cycling, but\nI’m not quite that confident with\lPOKéMON yet."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD914 {
    "I do my triathlon training with POKéMON,\nso I’m pretty confident about my speed."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD965 {
    "I need to get more practices in,\nI guess."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD98F {
    "Training is meaningful only if you\nkeep it up regularly.\pOkay! I’ll resume my training!\nTomorrow!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BD9F1 {
    "Are you keeping up with your training?\nI sure am!\lLet me show you the evidence!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDA41 {
    "I need to get more practices in,\nI guess."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDA6B {
    "I’ll resume training tomorrow.\nLet’s battle again sometime!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDAA7 {
    "Aunque victorioso de piquito… \pMejor compruebo yo mismo:  \naquì medallas no cuentan."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDAFC {
    "¡Guau!\nVen cuando quieras pasar dentro."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDBC3 {
    "ANNA: I’m with my pretty junior student\npartner. I have to do good!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDC07 {
    "ANNA: I’m with my pretty junior student\npartner! Let me win!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDC44 {
    "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\ncombinations.\pI’d say you’re second only to us!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDC96 {
    "ANNA: If you want to battle us, bring\ntwo POKéMON with you."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDCD2 {
    "MEG: I’m going to tag up with my super\nsenior student partner and beat you!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDD1E {
    "MEG: Oh, no!\nI’m sorry, ANNA! I let you down..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDD4E {
    "MEG: I dragged ANNA down...\nIf I didn’t, she would have won!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDD8B {
    "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\nWe can’t battle with you, then.\pWe want to have a 2-on-2 battle."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDDEF {
    "ANNA: I can’t keep losing in front of\nmy junior partner, right?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDE2F {
    "ANNA: I couldn’t get into the groove."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDE55 {
    "ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\ncombinations.\pI’d say you’re second only to us!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDEA7 {
    "ANNA: If you want to battle us, bring\ntwo POKéMON with you."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDEE3 {
    "MEG: I’m going to tag up with my\nsenior partner and win this time!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDF26 {
    "MEG: Too strong!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDF37 {
    "MEG: I battled together with my\nsenior partner, but we lost...\pThat’s so discouraging..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDF90 {
    "MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\nWe can’t battle with you, then.\pWe want to have a 2-on-2 battle."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BDFF4 {
    "The aroma of flowers has a magical\npower. It cleanses us body and soul."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BE03C {
    "Oh, dear me.\nI seem to have lost."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BE05E {
    "Flowers, POKéMON...\nI love whatever smells nice.\pStinky things...\nI’ll pass."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BE0AB {
    "Were you drawn here by the sweet\naroma?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BE0D3 {
    "The power of aroma...\nIt didn’t seem to do much."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081BE104 {
    "If you use a sweet aroma properly,\nPOKéMON will be attracted by it."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081C1C67 {
    "Isla MANDARINA   is still a long ways\naway..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081C1C95 {
    "My first victory seems to be far\naway, too..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081C1CC3 {
    "My whole life has been about losing,\nbut I will never give up!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081C1D02 {
    "I’m still feeling good. I’ll keep on\nswimming to EVER GRANDE CITY."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081C1D45 {
    "I’ve yet to taste my first victory..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_081C1D6B {
    "I’ll eventually reach EVER GRANDE CITY\nwhere I can eventually win..."
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_086B8340 {
    "Tu medalla dice que eres grande.\p¡Mola que pase alguien \ntan buen{RIVAL} como tú!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_086B838D {
    "¿Necesitas ayuda\npara despejar la entrada?"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_086B83B8 {
    "¡Bien hecho MACHOP!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_086B83CC {
    "¡Ahora ya puedes!"
}

text Naranja_Desierto_G00_M32_Text_086BEF40 {
    "Podrías cortar este árbol…\p…pero va a ser que no."
}
